{
  "title": { "zh": "回一声" },
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "<part-ref to=\"nic\"></part-ref>收得到帧，也核对得了每一帧，发帧的一方却还不知道结果。线那头要听到回话，这叫<wiki-ref to=\"ack\"></wiki-ref>。"
      }
    }
  ],
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "1-37",
      "brief": {
        "zh": "进线上每到一帧，就从出线回一个只有一个字节的帧：校验相符回 1，不符回 0。<part-ref to=\"nic\"></part-ref>在「发送」为 1 时取走输入上的字节，不论那是什么；没有回话等着时，「发送」为 0。"
      },
      "hint": [
        {
          "zh": "一帧结束、知道它好坏以后，才有回话可说。"
        },
        { "zh": "回话要先留住，等网卡取走。" }
      ],
      "wires": {
        "in": [{ "name": "rx", "label": { "zh": "进线" } }],
        "out": [{ "name": "tx", "label": { "zh": "出线" } }]
      },
      "tests": [
        { "ticks": 72, "wires": { "rx": { "send": [{ "frames": [[65]], "format": "flagbyte" }] } } },
        {
          "ticks": 72,
          "wires": { "rx": { "send": [{ "frames": [[65]], "format": "flagbyte" }], "flips": [9] } }
        },
        { "ticks": 115, "wires": { "rx": { "send": [{ "frames": [[255, 0], [126]], "format": "flagbyte" }] } } }
      ],
      "hidden": [
        {
          "ticks": 112,
          "wires": {
            "rx": { "send": [{ "frames": [[170, 85], [15]], "format": "flagbyte" }], "flips": [9, 12] }
          }
        },
        { "ticks": 40 },
        {
          "ticks": 140,
          "wires": { "rx": { "send": [{ "frames": [[1], [2], [3]], "format": "flagbyte" }], "flips": [40] } }
        }
      ],
      "want": { "tx": { "answers": { "wire": "rx", "format": "flagbyte" } } },
      "solution": [
        "z = const[value=0]()",
        "o = const[value=1]()",
        "pd = reg[reg=A, start=0]()",
        "pv = reg[reg=B, start=0]()",
        "n = nic(rx, pv, o, pd)",
        "ov = select(n.ok, o, z)",
        "nv = select(n.end, ov, pv)",
        "kv = keep[reg=B](nv)",
        "np0 = select(n.next, z, pd)",
        "np = select(n.end, o, np0)",
        "kp = keep[reg=A](np)",
        "tx <- n.tx"
      ],
      "naive": [
        "z = const[value=0]()",
        "o = const[value=1]()",
        "pd = reg[reg=A, start=0]()",
        "n = nic(rx, o, o, pd)",
        "np0 = select(n.next, z, pd)",
        "np = select(n.end, o, np0)",
        "kp = keep[reg=A](np)",
        "tx <- n.tx"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
